{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">2004 AMC 12A #15</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">2004 AMC 10A #17</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Brenda and Sally run in opposite directions on a circular track, starting at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diameter\" title=\"Diameter\">diametrically</a> opposite points.  They first meet after Brenda has run 100 meters.  They next meet after Sally has run 150 meters past their first meeting point.  Each girl runs at a constant speed.  What is the length of the track in meters?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e6378a4bebb98ac710142a128746b8247862a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 250 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 300 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 350 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }  400\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"435\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the length of the race track <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. When they meet at the first meeting point, Brenda has run <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> meters, while Sally has run <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cf8e40e3de5136d3608b4a595c42a68a3383195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{2} - 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"33\" /> meters. By the second meeting point, Sally has run <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> meters, while Brenda has run <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/13080cccfe104afdb653a46b433ac5b264b59684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> meters. Since they run at a constant speed, we can set up a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proportion\" title=\"Proportion\">proportion</a>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c953361a1967fdfaf6fb42f509be4123f9d0fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{x- 150} = \\frac{\\frac{x}{2} - 100}{150}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"151\" height=\"39\" />. Cross-multiplying, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/9/34912a89f66017997181ca655013373341833b8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 350\\Longrightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"173\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total distance the girls run between the start and the first meeting is one half of the track length. The total distance they run between the two meetings is the track length. As the girls run at constant speeds, the interval between the meetings is twice as long as the interval between the start and the first meeting. Thus between the meetings Brenda will run <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/2/8e2bb7680d28ee66dea4ae996852963d81596d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times100=200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> meters. Therefore the length of the track is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651c35215cdd7391e4dce51df444a9b7f398b2a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150 + 200 = 350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" /> meters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/b/60b1fffe8d76fda076f145ede1abe8926012b087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"95\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4Amr36L7otc\">https://youtu.be/4Amr36L7otc</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ju1qfxI0lIc\">https://youtu.be/ju1qfxI0lIc</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;s